{{ 'suntneew-a3-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section id="features" class="sn-a3-pdp" role="tabpanel" data-pdp-panel="features" aria-labelledby="a3-experience-heading-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell sn-a3-pdp__section">
    <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">FEATURES</p>
    <h2 class="sn-a3-pdp__heading" id="a3-experience-heading-{{ section.id }}">A complete 12V power kit for the road ahead.</h2>
    <p class="sn-a3-pdp__lede">A3 combines emergency starting power, portable device charging, lighting and guided clamp protection in one compact kit.</p>

    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-stack">
      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide">
        <img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-pdp-overview-v2.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 jump starter overview with capacity, peak current and PD charging information" width="1959" height="803" loading="lazy">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy">
          <div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">A3 OVERVIEW</p><h3>Starting power, charging and light in one carry-ready unit.</h3><p>A3 is a 16,000mAh emergency power tool for compatible 12V vehicles and everyday device charging away from a wall outlet.</p></div>
          <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metrics" aria-label="A3 feature overview"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>16,000mAh</strong><span>Rated capacity</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>59.2Wh</strong><span>Rated energy</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>2500A</strong><span>Peak current</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>800A</strong><span>Starting current</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide">
        <img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-pdp-starting-v2.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 super-power jump starter in a vehicle engine bay" width="1959" height="803" loading="lazy">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy">
          <div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">EMERGENCY STARTING POWER</p><h3>Ready when your battery is not.</h3><p>Designed for compatible 12V vehicle systems, A3 puts starting power and a guided smart-clamp connection in one travel-ready kit.</p></div>
          <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metrics" aria-label="A3 starting performance"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>2500A</strong><span>Peak current</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>800A</strong><span>Starting current</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>8.0L / 6.5L</strong><span>Gas / diesel capacity</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>50+</strong><span>Starts per full charge</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide">
        <img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-source-capacity.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 capacity and emergency power information" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy">
          <div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">CAPACITY FOR THE NEXT STOP</p><h3>Stored power you can check at a glance.</h3><p>The on-unit display shows battery percentage and active input or output information so the A3 is easier to check before you leave.</p></div>
          <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metrics" aria-label="A3 capacity and construction"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>50+</strong><span>Starts per full charge</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>PD 60W</strong><span>USB-C input and output</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>Aluminum alloy</strong><span>Housing material</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>764g</strong><span>Product weight</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide">
        <img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-source-pd.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 PD 60W USB-C charging connection" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy">
          <div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">PD 60W FAST CHARGING</p><h3>Power for more than the roadside.</h3><p>Use the USB-C power connection for compatible devices when you need portable power away from a wall outlet.</p></div>
          <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metrics" aria-label="A3 power delivery"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>PD 60W</strong><span>USB-C input and output</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>USB-C</strong><span>Power Delivery connection</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>USB-A ×2</strong><span>Additional USB outputs</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>IN / OUT</strong><span>Live status display</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-stack">
      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-pdp-light-source.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 150 lm LED light with steady, strobe and SOS modes" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy"><div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">150 LM LED LIGHT</p><h3>Light when the road goes dark.</h3><p>Integrated lighting gives the A3 a practical place in the vehicle kit, from routine checks to an unexpected roadside stop.</p></div><ul class="sn-a3-pdp__mode-list" aria-label="Light modes"><li>Steady</li><li>Strobe</li><li>SOS</li></ul></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="safety" class="sn-a3-pdp__section sn-a3-pdp__soft-section"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell"><article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-safety-v1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 intelligent jumper clamps and jump starter" width="1958" height="803" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy"><div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">INTELLIGENT JUMPER CLAMPS</p><h3>Eight safeguards around the connection.</h3><p>Confirm polarity and the clamp connection indication before starting. Follow the product and vehicle instructions for the complete connection and disconnection procedure.</p></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguards sn-a3-pdp__safeguards--compact" aria-label="Eight A3 protection functions"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>01</strong><span>Spark-proof</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>02</strong><span>Overtime</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>03</strong><span>Low voltage</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>04</strong><span>High temperature</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>05</strong><span>Short circuit</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>06</strong><span>Reverse polarity</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>07</strong><span>Reverse connection</span></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>08</strong><span>Over-current</span></div></div></div></article></div></div>

  <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell sn-a3-pdp__section"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-stack sn-a3-pdp__wide-stack--tight">
    <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-pdp-temperature-v2.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 in hot and cold weather conditions" width="1958" height="803" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy"><div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">OPERATING RANGE</p><h3>Built for the temperature swing.</h3><p>The aluminum-alloy A3 shell and documented operating range help keep the kit ready for changing road conditions.</p></div><div class="sn-a3-pdp__range-value sn-a3-pdp__range-value--light">-20°C to 60°C<span>Working temperature</span></div></div></article>
    <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-source-vehicle.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 vehicle application information" width="1464" height="600" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy"><div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">COMPATIBLE 12V VEHICLES</p><h3>One compact kit for everyday vehicle categories.</h3><p>For compatible 12V vehicle systems up to 8.0L gas or 6.5L diesel. Vehicle, battery condition and temperature affect results.</p></div><ul class="sn-a3-pdp__application-list"><li>Cars</li><li>SUVs</li><li>Pickups</li><li>Motorcycles</li><li>Boats</li><li>ATVs</li></ul></div></article>
  </div></div>

  <div id="how-it-works" class="sn-a3-pdp__steps sn-a3-pdp__section"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell"><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2 class="sn-a3-pdp__heading">Four clear steps before you start.</h2><p class="sn-a3-pdp__lede">Use this as a visual overview, then follow the A3 manual and the vehicle manufacturer’s instructions for the complete procedure.</p><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-grid"><article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-01.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Insert the smart-clamp plug into A3" width="341" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 01</span><h3>Connect the smart clamp.</h3><p>Insert the clamp plug fully into the A3.</p></div></article><article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-02.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Connect smart clamps to a vehicle battery" width="341" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 02</span><h3>Attach the clamps.</h3><p>Connect positive and negative clamps to the correct battery terminals.</p></div></article><article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-03.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 smart clamp green operating light" width="341" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 03</span><h3>Check the green light.</h3><p>Confirm the clamp’s operating indication before starting.</p></div></article><article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-04.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Press vehicle engine start button" width="338" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 04</span><h3>Start the vehicle.</h3><p>Start the compatible vehicle, then follow the manual for disconnection.</p></div></article></div></div></div>

</section>

